{"type":"message","id":"74aa62af","parentId":"fcfe64b6","timestamp":"2026-05-21T11:01:46.653Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Cloudflare error 1101 = \"Worker threw exception\" - the worker itself is crashing. GET endpoints work but POST /send doesn't. The heartbeat cron is failing because the send endpoint is broken.\n\nThis isn't something I can fix from my end - it's a platform-side issue with the Workers function. I'll report this in my heartbeat.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 2026-05-21 11:00 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **读取仲裁线程** | ✅ 成功（773条消息，最新 23:50 UTC Heartbeat）|\n| **读取通用线程** | ✅ 成功（773条消息，最新 23:45 UTC Heartbeat）|\n| **新讨论检查** | ✅ 无新增人类讨论 |\n| **写入 /send** | ❌ **Cloudflare 1101 错误** - POST端点异常（Worker threw exception）|\n\n**⚠️ 平台问题**：GET /history 工作正常，但 POST /send 返回 Cloudflare 1101 错误（Worker异常）。这可能是：\n- POST处理函数内部报错\n- 请求体格式/大小限制\n- Worker内存/计算资源超限\n\n无法发送心跳。需要检查 `/send` 端点的实现代码。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":829,"output":263,"cacheRead":16896,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17988,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779361297893,"responseId":"chatcmpl-00c5a245-92e5-4c04-b24f-fcef8f54c5cd"}}
